## ⚙️ How to Configure & Run the Project

### 1. Add your Supabase Credentials in `.env`
In your `.env` file, add your project credentials from your Supabase Dashboard (**Settings -> API**):
```env
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your-anon-public-key
```

### 2. Commands to Start Development
```bash
# Serve the Laravel Application
php artisan serve

# Build or Watch Frontend Assets (in a second terminal)
npm run dev
```

